{"code":"PS","name_cn":"市销率PS","l1":"公司内生信息","l2":"估值类","direction":-1,"doc_missing":false,"formula_mismatch":{"level":"ok","reason":""},"formula":{"doc":"PS =总市值/ TTM营业收入。其中当日总市值采用个股当日收盘总市值（总股本×当日收盘价），非流通市值计入统计，严格沿用全市值口径，保证全市场个股统计标准统一。营业收入采用TTM滚动求和口径，规避季报季节性波动。具体计算规则为当前已披露财报最新四个季度营业收入滚动求和，动态滚动更新。当个股营业收入TTM≤0时，PSTTM标记为无效值，不参与后续运算。","doc_tex":"","doc_note":"","system":"市销率PS = AShareValuationIndicator.S_VAL_PS_TTM（Wind 已算好，月末截面取值）","wind":"AShareValuationIndicator.S_VAL_PS_TTM"},"sample":{"stock_code":"600135.SH","stock_name":"乐凯胶片","trade_date":"2026-05-29","inputs":[{"label":"Wind 源","value":"AShareValuationIndicator.S_VAL_PS_TTM"}],"steps":["外部字段直取/变换：市销率PS = AShareValuationIndicator.S_VAL_PS_TTM（Wind 已算好，月末截面取值）"],"recomputed":null,"stored":3.7526,"match":null},"recon":{"status":"match","method":"source_recheck","n_checked":200,"n_match":200,"max_abs_diff":0.0,"tol":1e-06,"mismatches":[]},"dist":{"coverage":1.031,"min":-27979.479,"median":3.3152,"max":1892152.1,"hist":[263173,132407,62723,33211,19772,12070,7905,5409,3935,2845,2139,1635,1287,1051,904,692,581,561,474,5974]},"ic":{"mean_rank_ic":0.03742769661031076,"consistent_with_direction":false},"health":{"level":"warn","flags":["outlier","heavy_tail","direction_ic_flip"],"metrics":{"coverage":1.031,"coverage_period":"2015-01-30","abs_max":1892152.1,"robust_z_max":608195.23,"n_nonfinite":0,"rank_ic_mean":0.0374,"rank_ic_t":3.18}}}